# Same sequence as TradeIngestion.Api/TradeIngestion.Api.http
# Open that file in Visual Studio (REST Client) with the API running.

@host = https://localhost:7129

# --- ACC-001 (1–2 Oct 2026) ---

### Original
POST {{host}}/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "DEMO-ACC001-TRX-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 120,
  "price": 185.40,
  "tradeDate": "2026-10-01",
  "asOf": "2026-10-01T10:15:00Z"
}

### Duplicate
POST {{host}}/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "DEMO-ACC001-TRX-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 120,
  "price": 185.40,
  "tradeDate": "2026-10-01",
  "asOf": "2026-10-01T10:15:00Z"
}

### Snapshot 1 Oct (120 shares)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-001/snapshots?date=2026-10-01

### Correction
POST {{host}}/api/trades
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "DEMO-ACC001-TRX-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "instrument": { "isin": "US0378331005", "symbol": "AAPL" },
  "side": "BUY",
  "quantity": 100,
  "price": 185.40,
  "tradeDate": "2026-10-01",
  "asOf": "2026-10-02T09:00:00Z"
}

### Snapshot 1 Oct still 120
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-001/snapshots?date=2026-10-01

### Snapshot 2 Oct (100 shares)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-001/snapshots?date=2026-10-02

### Fee
POST {{host}}/api/cash
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "externalRef": "DEMO-ACC001-FEE-1001",
  "accountId": "ACC-001",
  "type": "FEE",
  "amount": -15.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "tradeDate": "2026-10-01",
  "asOf": "2026-10-01T10:20:00Z",
  "description": "Brokerage fee"
}

### Snapshot 1 Oct with fee (22305)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-001/snapshots?date=2026-10-01

### Snapshot 2 Oct with fee (18585)
GET {{host}}/api/accounts/ACC-001/snapshots?date=2026-10-02

